   "caption": "Your first frame does more work than your hook line. Ranked, S to F:\n\nS: the result on screen + one line of text (payoff first)\nA: your face mid-sentence + text\nB: text on a plain background\nC: slow b-roll with no text\nF: a logo intro or a black frame\n\nQuick test: pause on frame one with the sound off. If it makes sense alone, it's working.\n\nSend this to the friend whose reels open on a logo. Save it for your next edit.\n\n#reelstips #contentcreator #videoediting #instagramtips #creatortips #hooks",
