   "caption": "12 hours to a client pitch. 0 slides. 20 sticky notes. (Byte fixes · EP 10)\n\nClaude Whiteboards (beta, on paid plans, web/desktop/mobile) can turn a board into a doc or a presentation:\n1. Paste every sticky note onto one board\n2. Ask Claude to group them by theme (problem, plan, price)\n3. Ask it to turn the board into a deck, then rewrite it in your own words\n\nThe draft is a start. You own the pitch.\n\nComment IDEA and I'll DM you my free Reel Idea Machine (Claude skill + PDF guide).\n\n#claudeai #aitools #agencylife #freelancer #contentcreator #clientpitch",
